# sdd:note: copied to .graphifyignore only with the `graphify` option.
# graphify exclusions — cut "code understanding" noise (.gitignore syntax).
# Build/dependency folders already in .gitignore are excluded automatically.

# Lockfiles — huge, low value
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
uv.lock
poetry.lock
Cargo.lock
Gemfile.lock
composer.lock
go.sum

# Agent tooling — skill docs have nothing to do in the code graph
.claude/

# Markdown — excluded to keep the graph DETERMINISTIC. Without a semantic pass, a markdown file
# only yields orphan heading nodes with no edge to code; added commit after commit, they form an
# arbitrary partial index, more misleading than none. Docs: grep / direct read; openspec/specs/
# stays the behavioural source of truth.
**/*.md

# The graph itself
graphify-out/

# sdd:fill: stack-specific noise (stories, generated code, vendored deps, large fixtures), one line each with a comment — or nothing

# NB: tests are KEPT on purpose (usage/impact context useful to the LLM).
